 "remarks": "Sunny, airy, garden level studio apartment with private entrance and private stone patio, on a quiet, tree lined street with plenty of parking. Around the corner from Old Greenwich shops, cafes and restaurants, train station, beach and park. A short walk to Waterside's marinas, waterfront restaurants, beach/park and boardwalk with ferry to Harbor Point. The apartment has a separate laundry space with washer and dryer hookup. Smoke free property, no pets, good credit is a must. A wonderful location; a must see! Showings will start from this Friday 10/28.",
